		{
			"id":"aa6112430539f1e4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# VULUTRES BRIGADE\n\n## ~ Captain Taraka ~\n        \n\tBy 2250, the LGL conglomerate dominates the global economy.\nIts technological innovations have eroded individual independence,\nforcing citizens to rely on it for daily life. This tyranny spawns rebels and revolutionaries.\nTo suppress dissent, LGL employs cybernetic mercenaries.\nAmongst them, <mark><strong>Tarka and her Vulture Brigade</strong></mark> are the most feared in Jakarta.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2620,
			"y":-891,
			"width":740,
			"height":380
		},
