			"id":"f647927968cf3b9d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# S.A.M.U Military Medical Intervention Team\n\n> To aid injured soldiers and reduce casualties, a special division was created. This team of medical soldiers is trained to de-escalate situations and retrieve individuals in peril. Using advanced tear gas bombs and stealth balloon drones, these specialists have a significant impact on saving lives in the chaos of the battlefield.",
